      "email": "lidi.mayra@gmail.com",
      "message": "Create a new post\n\nAdd a form to blog/new.html containing Post fields (title and content)\nand adjust blog controller to handle its creation using JPA Repository.\n"
    },
    {
      "sha": "1f6170f3515d20b173d3bf3f72861951342dfcad",
